From cff56044de8ee19239c16e56cc97c9080a2a212c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tag2-port <tag2@local>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 13:28:19 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Tag2: new runtime ABI for current RPCS3 (Qt 6.12 /
 avcodec-63), drop U1, disable old updater, add packaging tools

- managed_paths follow the official RPCS3 Windows runtime; hashes come from TAG2_NATIVE/release.json
- runtime_abi qt612-tag2-rpcs3-master (old qt6102 R6-R20 packages are rejected)
- launch mode 1 (legacy rpcs3-u1.exe) refused with a clear message
- GitHub auto-update disabled (upstream Tag2 channel targets the old 7cfe96a1 runtime)
- tag2-port/make_release.py + README_KO.md
