 rpcs3/rpcs3qt/tag2_native_policy.inc  |  79 ++----------
 tag2-port/README_KO.md                |  60 +++++++++
 tag2-port/make_release.py             | 177 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 254 insertions(+), 70 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tag2-port/README_KO.md
 create mode 100644 tag2-port/make_release.py

